; Tradie RUN D - D-20 option B: entry AT the 50% zone, POI demoted to a score
; EURUSDm M15, dry run. Identical to RUN A (ER 0.20, MinSL 12) except:
;   InpEntryMode            0 = ENTRY_AT_ZONE   (was implicitly 1 = at POI)
;   InpMinConfluence        0 = no gate; measures the full signal population
;   InpMaxSLATR             3.0 -> 6.0  - REQUIRED, not tuning. With the entry
;                           mid-leg the stop spans zone -> sweep extreme (~half
;                           the leg), so the old 3.0xATR cap would strangle the
;                           very trades this change exists to create.
; Compare signal count against RUN A (14 signals / 5y).
; Witness lines in the Experts log:
;   Tradie D-20: entry=AT_ZONE (option B) ...
;   Tradie D-20: conf0=.. conf1=.. conf2=.. conf3=.. | signals by score: ...
; 
